  pipeline/     The quest data pipeline, which builds on QuestieDB.

  src/data/     The format of the quest data, and the race and class masks in
                it. The copyright holder also uses these files in the rest of
                the website under the proprietary terms above.

  public/data/  Quest data generated by the pipeline (not in this repository;
                built and published with the website). It is derived from
                QuestieDB (https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB) by the Questie
                team and contributors, and modified by the pipeline. Each file
                says which QuestieDB commit it was built from and when.

Also not covered by the proprietary terms above:

  public/maps/  World map art from World of Warcraft, (c) Blizzard
                Entertainment, Inc. Extracted from the game client by
                tools/maps/extract.py and shown on the site with that credit.
                Blizzard's rights in it are unaffected by this file.

The GPL parts are under the GPL because QuestieDB is. The Questie name and logo
are not used and are not covered by any of these terms.
